  "description": ".NET SDK for the BoxesNLines reverse geocoding API. Resolves GPS coordinates to ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 country and subdivision codes. Includes thread-safe LRU caching, automatic 429 retry with Retry-After support, exponential backoff on 5xx errors, and a typed exception hierarchy. Multi-targets net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0.",
